### Teams, invitations and roles. Paste access tokens from http/auth.http.

@host = http://localhost:8080/api/v1
@ownerToken = paste-access-token-of-the-team-owner
@inviteeToken = paste-access-token-of-the-invited-user

### Create a team (the caller becomes its OWNER)
# @name team
POST {{host}}/teams
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Acme" }

###
@team = {{team.response.body.id}}

### Invite an address (same answer whether or not it is registered)
# @name invitation
POST {{host}}/teams/{{team}}/invitations
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "ann@example.com", "role": "APPROVER" }

###
@invitationId = {{invitation.response.body.id}}

### The invitee sees it in /me (only with a verified email)
GET {{host}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{inviteeToken}}

### The invitee accepts
POST {{host}}/invitations/{{invitationId}}:accept
Authorization: Bearer {{inviteeToken}}

### Or declines
POST {{host}}/invitations/{{invitationId}}:decline
Authorization: Bearer {{inviteeToken}}

### Owner revokes a pending invitation
DELETE {{host}}/teams/{{team}}/invitations/{{invitationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

### Change a teammate's role (the last OWNER can never be demoted)
PATCH {{host}}/teams/{{team}}/members/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "role": "OWNER" }

### Remove a teammate
DELETE {{host}}/teams/{{team}}/members/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

### Leave the team
POST {{host}}/teams/{{team}}:leave
Authorization: Bearer {{inviteeToken}}
